# Whitelist model — everything is ignored by default.
# To track a new file type, add a `!`-line below. Do not flip to blacklist.

*

# Re-allow tracked paths
!.gitignore
**
!README.md
!.vscodeignore
!CLAUDE.md
!AGENTS.md
!PROJECT_LOG.md
!DESIGN_PRINCIPLES.md
!pyproject.toml
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!Cargo.toml
!.github/
!.github/**
!CHANGELOG.md
!LICENSE
!SUPPORT.md
!docs/
!docs/**
!scripts/
!scripts/**
!src/
!src/**
!tests/
!tests/**
!comms/
!comms/**

# Never track
.venv/
node_modules/
target/
dist/
build/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
artifacts/
